      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("We have almost crossed the mountains. We’re close to the lands of the free tribes. So far so good."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kwili",
            text: _("Halt! Who goes there?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("It is I, Kapou’e, son of the Black-Eye Karun. What do you want, dwarf?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kwili",
            text: _("Oh, so it’s another group o’ stinkin’ orcs, eh. Begone, or we shall wash our axes in yer blood."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Look, you pint-sized idiot, we aren’t out to kill you so why don’t you just scamper away and hide in a cave or something. We’ll be through here in a few hours."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helper",
            text: _("(<i>Snicker</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kwili",
            text: _("Your scorn and rudeness shall be your undoing. Dwarves, let no orc pass this way alive!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("It looks like we might have to fight them after all."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helper",
            text: _("Hey, Chief, I was thinking — dwarves are pretty slow; why don’t we just bypass them?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helper",
            text: _("I mean, we could defeat them easily but it would just slow us down."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("We could, but then again, if we crush them, then we can loot their treasury and their dwellings. The gold will be useful."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Whatever else happens, we have to pass through these mountains and I dislike leaving enemies to our rear. Stab, smite, and slay!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 0,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 1,
            y: 5,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Fsignpost.png",
          },
          {
